# Symbols -- cmap for Symbols.png (see docs/framebuf/bmfont.md)
# Symbols are reached by ASCII codes (e.g. wuss draws '*' for its menu tick
# and '>' for its submenu arrow). Blank cells are left unmapped.
U+0020..U+0027  0
U+002A          10    # * tick
U+002C..U+002E  12
U+0031..U+0034  17
U+0036          22
U+003C..U+003E  28    # > submenu arrow in the last cell
